Feature: F04 - Tags con Datos Dinámicos (Online Faker)

  @dynamic-tag @web @user1
  Scenario Outline: [F04-DYN-<id>] Tag con nombre dinámico generado en runtime
    Given I navigate to Ghost admin login page
    And I login with admin credentials
    And I navigate to the Tags section
    Given I navigate to the new tag form
    When I fill the tag name with the dynamic value for "<expected>"
    And I submit the tag form
    Then the tag creation should result in "<expected>"

    Examples:
      | id | expected |
      | 01 | success  |
      | 02 | success  |
      | 03 | success  |
      | 04 | success  |
      | 05 | success  |
      | 06 | success  |
      | 07 | success  |
      | 08 | success  |
      | 09 | success  |
      | 10 | success  |
      | 11 | error    |
      | 12 | error    |
